    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Ruinstorm Herald Conclave" hidden="false" id="7347-2e9e-8bc5-87b4">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Anchor of the Empyrean" id="956a-d939-0018-ed61" hidden="false">
          <description>Friendly units with the Daemon Unit Type within 12" of at least one Ruinstorm Herald ignore all negative Strength and Toughness modifiers caused by the Unstable Veil (Turn 5 and Turn 6+) rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Locus of Ruin" id="5176-3b88-ca6d-3d32" hidden="false">
          <description>At the start of the battle, before deployment, select one of the following Locus effects for each Ruinstorm Herald. This effect applies to the Herald and any unit with the Daemon Unit Type that the Herald joins. Locus of Slaughter: models in the unit gain Furious Charge (1). Locus of Corruption: models in the unit gain Feel No Pain (6+) (or improve an existing Feel No Pain roll by +1, to a maximum of 4+). Locus of Tempest: models in the unit re-roll To Hit rolls of 1 when making Shooting Attacks or manifesting Psychic Weapons. Locus of Sensation: models in the unit gain +1 Initiative and may re-roll failed Run and Charge Distance rolls.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Note" id="e86d-f349-37ff-8dfc" hidden="false">
          <description>In a unit of two or more, Ruinstorm Heralds lose Independent Character and gain Chosen Warriors. Ætheric Blessing: +15 points per model.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
