    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Ravenous Dissolution: The Void-Stalker of Spite" hidden="false" id="10c1-23fb-084c-baaa">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Emerge from the Shadow" id="825f-9ba7-6c84-497c" hidden="false">
          <description>Instead of deploying normally, the Void-Stalker may be placed in Shadow Ambush at the start of the game. From the second game turn onwards, at the start of any of the controlling player's Movement phases, the Void-Stalker may be placed anywhere on the battlefield within 3" of an enemy Character (and more than 1" away from enemy models) without scattering, and may declare a Charge in the same turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
