      <rules>
        <rule id="34c9-1700-27c4-7efb" name="Ætheric Blessing: Encroaching Ruin" hidden="false">
          <description>Models in a unit with this Ætheric Blessing gain the Fear (1) special rule (or increase an existing Fear value by +1), and enemy units within 6" of one or more units with this Blessing reduce their Cover Saves by -1 (to a minimum of 6+).</description>
