                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition type="lessThan" value="4" field="selections" scope="force" childId="9b5d-fac7-799b-d7e7" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="4974-b321-0d35-6137" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule id="9e23-20be-858c-6709" name="Prerequisites" hidden="false">
                  <description>• A Detachment using this Rite of War must include a Ruinstorm Harbinger or a Ruinstorm Daemon Sovereign as the army's Warlord.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="91de-055e-a6eb-376f" name="Effects" hidden="false">
                  <description>• Boundless Numbers: Ruinstorm Lesser Daemon Swarms and Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Packs in a Detachment using this Rite of War may increase their maximum unit size to up to 25 models (at their standard points cost per additional model), and may be purchased at -1 point per model for all models beyond the initial 10 in a unit.
• Surging Battleline: Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Packs in a Detachment using this Rite of War do not have the Support Squad special rule (allowing them to be selected as Compulsory Troops choices and control Objective markers).
• Weight of Bodies: Whenever a unit of Ruinstorm Lesser Daemon Swarms or Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Packs numbering 15 or more models fights in the Assault phase, every model in the unit gains the Furious Charge (1) special rule and adds +1 to its Combat Resolution score.
• Enduring Manifestation: Friendly Ruinstorm Lesser Daemon Swarms and Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Packs within 12" of a Ruinstorm Herald Conclave or Ruinstorm Harbinger suffer only 1 automatic wound instead of D3 automatic wounds when failing a Morale check.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="f14b-9f6e-0eb0-571e" name="Limitations" hidden="false">
                  <description>• A Detachment using this Rite of War may not include any Lords of War choices (such as Ruinstorm Arch-Daemons) or Heavy Support choices (such as Ruinstorm Daemon Behemoths, Cataclysm Brute Packs, or Soul-Forge Engines).
• A Detachment using this Rite of War must include at least four Troops choices.
• All Compulsory Troops choices in a Detachment using this Rite of War must be Ruinstorm Lesser Daemon Swarms.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Legion of the Brass Throne (Heedless Slaughter)" hidden="false" id="0efd-0061-3c2c-a449">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="3d70-1d54-a791-ac60" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
