              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule id="4ff7-3ce3-3639-1f7a" name="Prerequisites" hidden="false">
                  <description>• A Detachment using this Rite of War must be aligned to the Encroaching Ruin Ætheric Dominion, and must include a Ruinstorm Daemon Sovereign or Ruinstorm Harbinger equipped with the Encroaching Ruin Ætheric Blessing as the army's Warlord.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="5057-4187-d1ef-3dba" name="Effects" hidden="false">
                  <description>• Breakers of Bastions: Ruinstorm Daemon Brutes and Ruinstorm Greater Daemon Beasts may be selected as Troops choices in a Detachment using this Rite of War. Any unit selected as a Compulsory Troops choice in this manner gains the Line Unit Sub-type.
• Entropy Aura: Enemy Vehicles, Dreadnoughts, and Fortifications within 6" of any friendly Ruinstorm Daemon Behemoth, Daemon Brute, Cataclysm Brute Pack, or Soul-Forge Engine reduce all Armour Values by -1 (to a minimum of 10).
• Creeping Dread: Enemy units within 12" of two or more friendly units with the Daemon Unit Type suffer a -1 penalty to their Leadership Characteristic and may not benefit from Stubborn or Inspiring Presence rules.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="a5e6-ca27-8297-7b60" name="Limitations" hidden="false">
                  <description>• No unit in a Detachment using this Rite of War may deploy via Deep Strike (all units must deploy normally on the battlefield or arrive via standard Reserves from the controlling player's board edge).
• A Detachment using this Rite of War may not include any Ruinstorm Sky-Ray Packs.
• Every eligible unit in the Detachment must purchase the Encroaching Ruin Ætheric Blessing.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Soul-Forge Conclave (Malevolent Artifice)" hidden="false" id="6300-db26-7091-bbfb">
              <modifiers>
