                    <conditionGroup type="or">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="0654-98a0-becc-f11a" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </conditionGroup>
                  </conditionGroups>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="75fe-8f41-ed95-000d" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule id="191b-45fc-e008-5928" name="Prerequisites" hidden="false">
                  <description>• A Detachment using this Rite of War must be aligned to the Formless Distortion Ætheric Dominion, and must include a Ruinstorm Daemon Sovereign or Ruinstorm Harbinger equipped with the Formless Distortion Ætheric Blessing as the army's Warlord.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="17a5-5579-3dd6-5f00" name="Effects" hidden="false">
                  <description>• Shifting Hosts: Any Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Pack, Ruinstorm Incinerator Swarm, or Ruinstorm Daemon Brute unit may be selected as a Troops choice in a Detachment using this Rite of War. Any unit selected as a Compulsory Troops choice in this manner gains the Line Unit Sub-type.
• Dual Mutation: Whenever a unit in this Detachment selects a mutation from the Formless Distortion Ætheric Blessing at the start of the turn, it may select two different mutations instead of one (affecting Lesser Daemon Swarms, Brutes, Beasts, Sky-Rays, Flesh-Reapers, Cataclysm Brutes, Behemoths, and Sovereigns alike).
• Unstable Reality: At the start of each game turn, roll a D6: on a 4+, the controlling player may immediately remove one friendly unit with the Daemon Unit Type that is not locked in combat and redeploy it via Deep Strike anywhere on the battlefield more than 9" away from enemy models.</description>
                </rule>
                <rule id="c435-7e18-e0dd-572b" name="Limitations" hidden="false">
                  <description>• A Detachment using this Rite of War may not include any Ruinstorm Soul-Forge Engines or Corrupted Engines.
• All Compulsory Troops choices in a Detachment using this Rite of War must be Ruinstorm Lesser Daemon Swarms or Ruinstorm Warp-Spawn Packs.
• Every eligible unit in the Detachment must purchase the Formless Distortion Ætheric Blessing.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <costs>
        <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
  </selectionEntries>
  <sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
    <selectionEntryGroup id="2f76-74c1-d329-d3ab" name="Warlord Traits (Ruinstorm Daemons)" hidden="true" collective="false" import="true">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="0176-56a3-d590-b103" type="greaterThan"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
        <modifier type="set" field="b166-ea7-b5d4-d09b" value="1">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="0176-56a3-d590-b103" type="greaterThan"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
      </modifiers>
      <constraints>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="b166-ea7-b5d4-d09b" type="min"/>
        <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="7337-2693-1ae3-ce73" type="max"/>
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="9bab-545c-9f9d-e018" name="Ruinstorm Daemons Warlord Traits" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="554-8210-6ec7-1913" type="max"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Lord of the Unstable Veil" hidden="false" id="59d6-b34a-3140-27cb">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="9e3d-4b12-29e5-1faa" name="Lord of the Unstable Veil" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Friendly units composed entirely of models with the Daemon Unit Type within 12" of a Warlord with this Trait ignore all negative Strength and Toughness modifiers caused by the Unstable Veil (Turn 5 and Turn 6+) rule, and suffer 1 fewer automatic wound (to a minimum of 0) whenever they fail a Morale check. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Movement phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Scourge of the Material Realm" hidden="false" id="95b0-9484-54a9-7d9f">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="12ed-11ab-6958-1d8c" name="Scourge of the Material Realm" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">A Warlord with this Trait increases his Fear special rule to Fear (2) (or Fear (3) if he already possesses Fear (2)), and all Melee weapons he wields gain the Murderous Strike (5+) and Brutal (2) special rules. Furthermore, enemy units within 6" of the Warlord suffer a -1 penalty to their Adamantium Will and Shield of Faith rolls. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Assault phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Herald of the Great Breach" hidden="false" id="dd9c-b10f-09a7-6a3d">
              <profiles>
                <profile id="904c-4e34-7503-fae0" name="Herald of the Great Breach" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">While a Warlord with this Trait is on the battlefield, friendly units with the Daemon Unit Type arriving via Deep Strike within 12" of the Warlord do not scatter when placed on the battlefield, and the controlling player may add +1 to all Reserves rolls made for units in the Warlord's Detachment. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Shooting phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Herald of the Brass Throne" hidden="false" id="cf71-c13a-e3ca-982f">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="3d70-1d54-a791-ac60" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="4fdc-327d-3007-28d1" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="3d70-1d54-a791-ac60" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="4fdc-327d-3007-28d1" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="1531-488a-2b2e-408f" name="Herald of the Brass Throne" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Heedless Slaughter only. A Warlord with this Trait, and any unit he joins, gains the Preferred Enemy (Everything) special rule when fighting in the Assault phase, and adds +2" to its Charge Distance rolls. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Assault phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Lord of the Blighted Host" hidden="false" id="8553-8d0c-8097-71cb">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="b7db-bf16-47c5-dc05" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="1292-d32c-4dc1-4516" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="b7db-bf16-47c5-dc05" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="1292-d32c-4dc1-4516" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="0299-a5cd-840a-605a" name="Lord of the Blighted Host" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Putrid Corruption only. Friendly units with the Daemon Unit Type within 12" of a Warlord with this Trait improve their It Will Not Die roll by +1 (to a maximum of 4+) and re-roll failed Feel No Pain rolls of 1. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Shooting phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Architect of Fate" hidden="false" id="8325-c7b4-69d4-951f">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="e4fb-66cd-e07d-609b" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="6dde-f28c-4e50-0e94" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="e4fb-66cd-e07d-609b" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="6dde-f28c-4e50-0e94" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="eac2-c0f7-1d06-5f0e" name="Architect of Fate" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Infernal Tempest only. Once per game, while a Warlord with this Trait is on the battlefield, the controlling player may re-roll any single dice roll (including a single dice as part of a 2D6 roll) or force the opposing player to re-roll a single successful dice roll. Furthermore, the Warlord may manifest one additional Psychic Weapon or Psychic Power per phase. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Shooting phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Sovereign of Excess" hidden="false" id="0ff2-8ab8-c733-83da">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="1214-3abe-c6d1-2038" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="1563-f33d-1cec-a940" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="1214-3abe-c6d1-2038" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="1563-f33d-1cec-a940" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="92c7-d639-3434-c50c" name="Sovereign of Excess" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Rapturous Sensation only. A Warlord with this Trait, and any unit he joins, gains the Hit &amp; Run and Sudden Strike (1) special rules, and increases its Fear value by +1 (e.g., from Fear (1) to Fear (2)). In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Assault phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Harbinger of Inevitable End" hidden="false" id="f772-2944-5a16-56f8">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="ca6c-e8cf-7bc1-eaa0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="28db-b99b-b00b-6698" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="ca6c-e8cf-7bc1-eaa0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="28db-b99b-b00b-6698" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="37d7-2dc8-30e6-eae1" name="Harbinger of Inevitable End" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Encroaching Ruin only. Enemy units within 12" of a Warlord with this Trait may not make Reactions in the Movement or Assault phases, and suffer a -1 penalty to their Leadership Characteristic (to a maximum penalty of -2 from all sources). In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Movement phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Master of the Soul-Forge" hidden="false" id="8a85-5713-e30d-8e89">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="9508-8124-d34a-500a" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="2262-e927-2dfa-2263" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="9508-8124-d34a-500a" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="2262-e927-2dfa-2263" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="9c74-dbb2-a579-dfdd" name="Master of the Soul-Forge" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Malevolent Artifice only. Friendly Corrupted Engines, Soul-Forge Engines, Daemon Behemoths, and Cataclysm Brute Packs within 12" of a Warlord with this Trait may re-roll failed To Hit rolls of 1 with all ranged and Melee weapons, and automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Shooting phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Avatar of Cosmic Spite" hidden="false" id="1327-d7b2-f9b7-eb4c">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="945c-b969-75eb-19d9" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="14b5-a97a-afd1-027c" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="945c-b969-75eb-19d9" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="14b5-a97a-afd1-027c" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="c042-a435-0d71-2f7e" name="Avatar of Cosmic Spite" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Ravenous Dissolution only. A Warlord with this Trait, and any unit he joins, re-rolls all failed To Wound rolls in the Assault phase against units containing at least one model with the Daemon, Corrupted, Corrupted Engine, Malefic, or Psyker Unit Type or Sub-type, or any unit with the Faith special rule. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Assault phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Weaver of the Unbound Veil" hidden="false" id="c5a2-befb-3eea-66a0">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="8ed0-3582-f536-c48e" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
                <modifier type="set" field="334d-b434-1661-6e5e" value="0">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition type="lessThan" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="8ed0-3582-f536-c48e" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <constraints>
                <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="334d-b434-1661-6e5e" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="648e-5461-2fa3-8e18" name="Weaver of the Unbound Veil" hidden="false" typeId="a0e6-a7b4-d55d-85b8" typeName="Warlord Trait">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Text" typeId="c68e-2cda-b67b-baca">Formless Distortion only. At the start of each of the controlling player's turns, while a Warlord with this Trait is on the battlefield, the controlling player may select one friendly unit with the Daemon Unit Type within 18" of the Warlord to gain either +1 Strength, +1 Toughness, or a 4+ Daemonic Invulnerable Save until the start of the controlling player's next turn. In addition, an army whose Warlord has this Trait may make one additional Reaction during the opposing player's Movement phase, as long as the Warlord has not been removed as a casualty.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <entryLinks>
      </entryLinks>
    </selectionEntryGroup>
  </sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
</catalogue>
